coach "Stop the Run"
about "Eight in the box until they prove they can throw it."

defense:
  when they pass over 60% -> call "Cover 3" or "Cover 1"
  when third down and to go over 7 -> call "Cover 3" or "Cover 2"
  otherwise -> call "Run Blitz" or "Run Blitz" or "Cover 1"

lineup:
  DL "Bull Rusher"
  LB "Thumper"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Enforcer"
